<title>SPAIN: Spain's chances to join EMU launch improve - B/Spain.</title>
<headline>Spain's chances to join EMU launch improve - B/Spain.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Spain Governor Luis Angel Rojo said the probability of Spain taking part in the launch of Europe's single currency has increased strongly, according to an address accompanying the Bank of Spain's annual report.  </p>
<p>The address, published along the annual report, said policies orientated toward greater stability and flexibilisation of the Spanish economy have obtained important results &quot;that have strongly raised the probability that Spain joins European economic and monetary union from the first moment.&quot;</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
